id: divine-element
name: Divine Element
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerBaseTier: 2
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Domain Maneuver (God of a Domain (3)), a God Maneuver: open while the Domain in brackets is yours, only in God Ki, paid in Divine Ki Points.
godManeuver: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You unleash the godly fury of nature, striking a blow with one of the primordial elements of creation.
text: >
  Divine Element [1/Round]: You unleash the godly fury of nature, striking a blow with one of the primordial elements of creation.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –DKP Cost: 2(bT)
  –Effect: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. This Attacking Maneuver must use your Favored Element as a Profile.

---

[on used]
domainStrike(element);
